WEBVTT

01:04:58.958 --> 01:05:02.476
But given the circumstances of my life,
this is not the right moment.

01:05:02.500 --> 01:05:05.434
And I think it's juggling that ambiguity

01:05:05.458 --> 01:05:07.226
that is the most difficult thing.

01:05:07.250 --> 01:05:10.851
On occasion, many of us will say,

01:05:10.875 --> 01:05:14.768
"This, I left too soon,
and this, I could have left sooner."

01:05:14.792 --> 01:05:16.351
This is the story of our lives,

01:05:16.375 --> 01:05:18.601
in relationships, in work situations,

01:05:18.625 --> 01:05:22.726
in places where we lived
in houses that were leaking.

01:05:22.750 --> 01:05:25.726
I mean, it's like we are constantly --

01:05:25.750 --> 01:05:30.518
And the story of our lives is a story
of where we wished we had stayed longer